<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Have you felt the Savior near?</l><l>Still there’s more to follow;</l><l>Does His blessed presence cheer?</l><l>Still there’s more to follow.</l><l>Oh, the grace that Jesus shows,</l><l>Still there’s more to follow;</l><l>Freely He His grace bestows,</l><l>Still there’s more to follow.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Have you felt the Spirit’s power?</l><l>Still there’s more to follow;</l><l>Falling like the gentle shower?</l><l>Still there’s more to follow.</l><l>Oh, the power the Spirit shows,</l><l>Still there’s more to follow;</l><l>Freely He His power bestows,</l><l>Still there’s more to follow.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
